{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>YOU ARE NOT ALICE</strong> is a social engineering sandbox game where you play the role of a hacker who has taken over Alice's work computer.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your goal is to spread through her company by talking to her coworkers and convincing them to run a virus file you can send them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn about Alice, her coworkers, and her company as you explore this open-world conversational sandbox that changes every time you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510450/extras/yana-library-hero.png?t=1746058161\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you infect each employee's computer, you'll be able to...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Browse their computer files</strong>\u00a0to learn about them, their job, and their relationships with other employees.<i> Sometimes you'll find a personal file or two, too.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Masquerade as others\u00a0</strong>by using their chat login to talk to their coworkers.<i>\u00a0Take advantage of their trust by convincing their coworkers to run your virus file.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Take over other computers</strong>\u00a0as you spread throughout the network: every employee has a new story and new connections to infect.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your own adventure: will you help each employee, or pretend to be them while making things much worse?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>What is this company hiding?</i>\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3510450?t=1746058161","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as