rs</strong>\u00a0as you spread throughout the network: every employee has a new story and new connections to infect.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your own adventure: will you help each employee, or pretend to be them while making things much worse?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>What is this company hiding?</i>\u00a0</p>","developers":["Andrew Brown","Andrew Noel"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510450/1eaec13bfd1e37239d782388dc06a83697f80a9a/header.jpg?t=1746058161","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257133685,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257133685/movie480.mp4?t=1746058095","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257133685/movie_max.mp4?t=1746058095"},"name":"First Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257133685/2888bff7fde0b4dbd14e19fef5c0bfbf459b4228/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746058095","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257133685/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1746058095","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257133685/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1746058095"}}],"name":"You Are Not Alice","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Chroma Golem"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Linguagem impr\u00f3pria\nAtos criminosos","rating":"14","rating_generated":"1","required_a